        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flesh, money, and chrome. Welcome to the underworld of cybernetic enhancement.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not like any other retail sim. In <strong>Ripperdoc Simulator</strong>, you are the surgeon of the shadows — a black-market specialist who installs cybernetic body mods in the darkest corners of a sprawling cyberpunk megalopolis. By day, you run a dingy electronics shop in a crime-ridden district, trading in junk tech and refurbished gear. By night, you perform illegal implantations on desperate clients seeking power, beauty, or survival — no matter the cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Clinic from the Shadows</strong><br>Disguise your operation behind a cluttered tech store. Sell modded devices, source rare components, and keep the authorities off your trail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform Gruesome Procedures</strong><br>Extract eyes, amputate limbs, and replace flesh with chrome in fully interactive, gore-drenched surgeries. Every implant has a purpose — and a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the City’s Desperate and Dangerous</strong><br>From street thugs to corpo defectors, clients will come to you with their own stories, demands, and risks. Will you enhance them… or exploit them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Setup</strong><br>Improve your tools, expand your hidden operating theater, and acquire illicit software to unlock new procedures and modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Cyberpunk Grind</strong><br>Balance the life of a shady ripperdoc with the gritty economy of the slums. Buy low, sell high, and trade favors with gangs, fixers, and black-market vendors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter a World of Flesh and Steel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic cyberpunk, body horror, and dark dystopian futures, <strong>Ripperdoc Simulator</strong> throws you into the pulsing veins of a broken society — where salvation is sold by the inch, and your scalpel is the key to survival.</p>",
